WEBVTT

00:02:00.366 --> 00:02:04.370
Magic, real magic is not an illusion.

00:02:05.621 --> 00:02:08.124
Real magic is the feeling

00:02:08.124 --> 00:02:11.919
when life transforms
from the ordinary into the extraordinary.

00:02:13.921 --> 00:02:16.048
And not only is it real.

00:02:16.090 --> 00:02:19.760
It is the very thing
that connects us to this world,

00:02:19.802 --> 00:02:21.554
to one another,

00:02:21.596 --> 00:02:23.264
to our entire existence.

00:02:24.015 --> 00:02:26.142
It's the spark of a moment.

00:02:26.559 --> 00:02:29.228
It's the feeling of believing,

00:02:29.270 --> 00:02:30.688
of belonging,